# Job Application Assistant

AI-powered job application assistant that analyzes a CV file and job description, then generates CV-job match analysis, cover letters, and interview preparation questions.

## Features

- PDF/DOCX CV upload
- CV text extraction
- CV and job description analysis
- Match score generation
- Strengths and weaknesses detection
- Turkish/English cover letter generation
- Turkish/English interview preparation
- SQLite history records
- Streamlit web interface

## Tech Stack

Python, FastAPI, Streamlit, SQLite, SQLAlchemy, Gemini API, pypdf, python-docx

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/analyze` | Analyze CV and job description |
| POST | `/cover-letter` | Generate cover letter |
| POST | `/interview-prep` | Generate interview questions |
| GET | `/history` | List previous results |

## Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/berataltinsuyu/job-application-assistant.git
cd job-application-assistant
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create a `.env` file:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```

Run backend:

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

Run frontend:

```bash
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
```

## Türkçe Özet

Bu proje, CV dosyası ve iş ilanı metni üzerinden yapay zeka destekli başvuru analizi yapan bir uygulamadır. Kullanıcı CV yükleyebilir, iş ilanını girebilir ve sistem CV uyum analizi, kapak yazısı ve mülakat hazırlığı oluşturur.

